<title>UK: PSK sets $200 million Dec 2000 bond. [CORRECTED 14:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>PSK sets $200 million Dec 2000 bond. [CORRECTED 14:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE POSTSPARKASSE</p>
<p> (Corrects borrower from PSK Rent Miteigentumsfonds.)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    29 DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.18    PAY DATE  S-24.FEB.97</p>
<p> (Corrects pay date from 24.FEB.96.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.755    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AUS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  1.425</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
